    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.poster.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.webm?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.mp4?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jim lives an orderly life with his wife in Greedtown. After an unpleasant fact about his gastronomic deviation comes to light, Elsa decides to throw him out onto the street. In the harsh environment of the suburbs, his adventure begins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/5dda19aa8eba4d32256abb8fe0c9e93d.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The city is full of delicacies. Don`t hesitate to satisfy your endless hunger!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth, be fast and clever. Once you`re on the run, use powerful items to escape. Take advantage of reckless car drivers, secret wormholes or slippery sh*ts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fool the enemy with suitable baits or camouflage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with puzzles, mazes and quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by recycling empty bottles and buy some treats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the revealing story filled with funny dialogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the items and you`ll be rewarded with bonus levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.poster.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.webm?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.mp4?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.poster.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.webm?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/b2a11f76586c3214b99a8880a200e3fb.mp4?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jim lives an orderly life with his wife in Greedtown. After an unpleasant fact about his gastronomic deviation comes to light, Elsa decides to throw him out onto the street. In the harsh environment of the suburbs, his adventure begins\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/5dda19aa8eba4d32256abb8fe0c9e93d.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The city is full of delicacies. Don`t hesitate to satisfy your endless hunger!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth, be fast and clever. Once you`re on the run, use powerful items to escape. Take advantage of reckless car drivers, secret wormholes or slippery sh*ts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fool the enemy with suitable baits or camouflage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with puzzles, mazes and quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins by recycling empty bottles and buy some treats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the revealing story filled with funny dialogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the items and you`ll be rewarded with bonus levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.poster.avif?t=1747315524\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.webm?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723200/extras/bada6325b07502df05dcd3d2637aa17d.mp4?t=1747315524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "BG is a funny stealth-action adventure with tactical approach. In the role of a hungry guy in need, you must search for food and avoid its guards. Be careful and patient, or let the chase begin. Get rid of your pursuers somehow, solve puzzles, quests, and immerse yourself in a tragicomic story.",
